  - m_Id: 7910223939977216
    m_Localized: Core steering component that transmits steering force from the wheel
      to the gearbox and wheels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7910093115441152
    m_Localized: Braking device that slows down or stops a vehicle in motion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7909806564786176
    m_Localized: Vehicle door that helps passengers get in and out and protects against
      side impacts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7911390669520896
    m_Localized: Integrated control unit that manages the heat of the high-voltage
      battery and motor and regulates the indoor temperature.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7911262181212160
    m_Localized: Core motor that converts electrical energy into mechanical energy
      to generate driving force for the front wheels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7910642338578432
    m_Localized: Device that absorbs road shocks received by the front wheels to
      improve ride comfort and steering stability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7910504861876224
    m_Localized: A front storage space unique to electric vehicles created by utilizing
      the engine room space of existing internal combustion engines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7910571366760448
    m_Localized: Device that increases force (torque) by lowering the high rotation
      speed of the drive motor and transmits power to the wheels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7911842744188928
    m_Localized: Opening cover that covers the engine room (or frunk) at the front
      of the vehicle to protect internal components.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7911934079352832
    m_Localized: High-voltage drive motor located at the rear of the vehicle that
      transmits direct driving force to the rear wheels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918957072302088
    m_Localized: Device that safely distributes power from the high-voltage battery
      to the rear motor and other high-voltage components.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7912243153420288
    m_Localized: Device that absorbs road shocks from the rear wheels and maintains
      the level of the vehicle body to provide driving stability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7912492253134848
    m_Localized: Interior vehicle seats designed for passengers to ride safely and
      comfortably.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7913846019276800
    m_Localized: Core component that stores large amounts of electrical energy needed
      for vehicle operation and consists of numerous battery cells and a management
      system (BMS).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7913088951599104
    m_Localized: Supplies power to the vehicle's electronic systems (lighting, infotainment,
      control modules, etc.) and provides relay operating power to start the high-voltage
      system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7913945499779072
    m_Localized: An inlet device for connecting an external charger connector to
      charge a high-voltage battery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918957072302089
    m_Localized: The basic skeleton that forms the framework of the vehicle and the
      most core structure where all parts are mounted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918957072302090
    m_Localized: A protective cover attached to the bottom of the vehicle to protect
      lower components and reduce air resistance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918957076496384
    m_Localized: The entire driver's seat module including the instrument cluster,
      audio, and air conditioner vents in front of the driver's seat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918957076496385
    m_Localized: Orange high-voltage wiring bundle that transmits large currents
      between the battery, inverter, and motor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918957076496386
    m_Localized: An ECU and low-voltage wiring system that controls various electronic
      devices in the vehicle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918957076496387
    m_Localized: Raised part in the center of the interior floor that serves as a
      passage for wiring or cooling pipes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918957076496388
    m_Localized: Skeleton at the very back of the vehicle where the tail lamps and
      rear bumper are mounted.
